// Title: an arm nothing reaches has its body checked first, so its bind,
// typed `[]`, reports an arithmetic error where the arm is unreachable.
// Command: graphix --no-cache --check x-typecheck-patterns-dead-arm-body-error.gx
// Expected: "unreachable arm: the earlier arms already cover the whole
//   scrutinee", as `|x| select x { null as _ => 0, v => v }` reports (the
//   skill's gotcha: a type test over an untyped parameter binds it).
// Observed: "cannot compute [] + i64: arithmetic is fn<'a: Number +
//   Singleton>(x: 'a, y: 'a) -> 'a — both operands must be one numeric type"
|x| select x { null as _ => 0, v => v + 1 }
